# purpose: M1+M2 regression at medium size while the team works on the journal.
# exercises: the same rule set as m2, in a different order, with different accounts.
OPEN acc-a EUR
OPEN acc-b EUR
OPEN acc-c GBP
DEPOSIT acc-a 10.10
DEPOSIT acc-b 20.20
DEPOSIT acc-c 30.30
WITHDRAW acc-a 0.10
WITHDRAW acc-b 20.21
WITHDRAW acc-b 20.20
FREEZE acc-c
DEPOSIT acc-c 1
BALANCE acc-c
UNFREEZE acc-c
DEPOSIT acc-c 1
CLOSE acc-b
DEPOSIT acc-b 1
OPEN acc-b USD
OPEN acc-d USD
DEPOSIT acc-d -1
DEPOSIT acc-d 0
DEPOSIT acc-d 1
WITHDRAW acc-d 1.01
FREEZE acc-d
FREEZE acc-d
CLOSE acc-d
UNFREEZE acc-d
WITHDRAW acc-d 1
CLOSE acc-d
OPEN acc-e CHF
DEPOSIT acc-e 1
DEPOSIT acc-a 90
BALANCE acc-a
BALANCE acc-b
BALANCE acc-c
BALANCE acc-d
BALANCE acc-e
